### Incident: Dashboard Outage (June 2024)

**Root Cause**: Database connection leak in audit runner
**What We Did Wrong**: Tried to restart app first (made it worse)
**What We Should Have Done**: Kill audit runner, then restart app
**Time to Resolution**: 47 minutes (target: <30)

**Takeaway**: Always kill the offender process BEFORE restarting services

### Incident: Credential Rotation Failure (March 2024)

**Root Cause**: Cached credentials in 3 services, only restarted 2
**What We Did Wrong**: Didn't follow the full rotation checklist
**What We Should Have Done**: Restart ALL dependent services including alerting service
**Time to Resolution**: 2 hours

**Takeaway**: The checklist exists for a reason. Follow it completely.

